{"id":"n24873-1-7","stage":1,"title":"참외 · 香瓜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24873-1-7-1","ko":"어제 산 참외가 겉은 노랗게 잘 익었는데 속이 다 썩었지 뭐야.","zh":"昨天买的香瓜，外皮又黄又熟，谁知里面全烂了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참외가","meaning":"香瓜，甜瓜","explanation":"참외：香瓜，甜瓜；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"참외","audio":"/audio/42f9da68025f304a1b9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24873","senseId":"1","lemma":"참외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겉은","meaning":"外面，表面，表","explanation":"겉：外面，表面，表；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"겉","audio":"/audio/190590ebae043637dc00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31329","senseId":"1","lemma":"겉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노랗게","meaning":"黄色的","explanation":"노랗다：黄色的；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"노랗다","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40101","senseId":"1","lemma":"노랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"익었는데","meaning":"熟，成熟","explanation":"익다：熟，成熟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"익다","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63510","senseId":"1","lemma":"익다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속이","meaning":"里，内，里边","explanation":"속：里，内，里边；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"1","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"썩었지","meaning":"腐败，腐烂","explanation":"썩다：腐败，腐烂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"썩다","audio":"/audio/b0d5a487db4674cfe726.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65171","senseId":"1","lemma":"썩다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야.","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"42f9da68025f304a","term":"참외","zh":"香瓜，甜瓜","audio":"/audio/42f9da68025f304a1b9e.mp3","entryId":"24873","definition":"一种主要在夏天吃的果实，色黄味甜。","pronunciation":["차뫼","차뭬"]},{"id":"190590ebae043637","term":"겉","zh":"外面，表面，表","audio":"/audio/190590ebae043637dc00.mp3","entryId":"31329","definition":"在有里外的东西中，东西的外侧部分。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"c4c95c7fd5963a0f","term":"노랗다","zh":"黄色的","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3","entryId":"40101","definition":"和香蕉或柠檬相同的颜色。","pronunciation":["노ː라타"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"615092c47f4ab18c","term":"익다","zh":"熟，成熟","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3","entryId":"63510","definition":"果实或种子长成。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"里，内，里边","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"被外皮或外壳包裹的物体的里面部分。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"b0d5a487db4674cf","term":"썩다","zh":"腐败，腐烂","audio":"/audio/b0d5a487db4674cfe726.mp3","entryId":"65171","definition":"食物或自然物质等被细菌分解而变腐或变坏。","pronunciation":["썩따"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f23793dc7237c9e6e4f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24873-1-7-2","ko":"저런, 많이 속상했겠구나.","zh":"哎呀，一定很郁闷吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속상했겠구나.","meaning":"伤心，难过","explanation":"속상하다：伤心，难过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"속상하다","audio":"/audio/a1d7a98c9fd33d129248.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15595","senseId":"1","lemma":"속상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a1d7a98c9fd33d12","term":"속상하다","zh":"伤心，难过","audio":"/audio/a1d7a98c9fd33d129248.mp3","entryId":"15595","definition":"因为事与愿违，心里不舒服、很痛苦。","pronunciation":["속ː쌍하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/66df7e4bd1e90b73f170.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24873","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":2.8637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，一定很郁闷吧。","昨天买的香瓜，外皮又黄又熟，谁知里面全烂了。","光线太暗了，字看不清楚。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天买的香瓜，外皮又黄又熟，谁知里面全烂了。","光线太暗了，字看不清楚。","哎呀，一定很郁闷吧。"],"answer":2}]}
